      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠠᠶᠤᠯ ᠡᠴᠡ ᠪᠣᠯᠲᠠᠵᠤ ᠳᠤᠲᠠᠭᠠᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>ajul ece --zu dutaγaxu</transcript>
          <definition>To flee from danger.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠠᠯᠪᠠᠨ ᠡᠴᠡ ᠪᠣᠯᠲᠠᠵᠤ ᠳᠤᠲᠠᠭᠠᠬᠤ</unicode>
